# Development Log & Versioning

## DevLog Location
`DEVLOG.md` in project root.

## Version Format
`X.Y.Z` - Semantic versioning
- **X** - Major (breaking changes)
- **Y** - Minor (new features)
- **Z** - Patch (bug fixes)

## Version Milestones
- `0.x.x` - Beta/Development
- `1.0.0` - First stable release

## Agent Responsibility
**ALWAYS** add a version note to `DEVLOG.md` when:
- Adding new features
- Fixing significant bugs
- Changing module structure
- Modifying configuration schema
- Updating API endpoints

## Entry Format
```markdown
## Version X.Y.Z - DD-MMM-YYYY
### Added
- Feature description

### Changed
- Change description

### Fixed
- Bug fix description
```

## Current Version
See `DEVLOG.md` for current version and changelog.
